rd in math literature maybe. Definitely not for the average person. \r\n\r\nIf instance count is 1 then the certain phrasing is still correct. The value must be 0 or a positive number less than 1, which is also 0. It communicates the same thing as non negative. \r\n\r\nAgain the problem with non negative is that you are instructing the user what not to do instead of what to do. You add an extra step for them to figure out what they did wrong and how to fix it. Error messages (and documentation) should focus on telling users what to do, not what not to do. ","created_at":"2025-02-01T18:00:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T18:00:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101109#discussion_r1938316925","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101109","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938316925"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101109#discussion_r1938316925"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101109"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938316925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":258,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1938241283,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":17,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938318236","pull_request_review_id":2588379120,"id":1938318236,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5ziGOc","diff_hunk":"@@ -249,39 +255,56 @@ void MultiMesh::set_physics_interpolation_quality(PhysicsInterpolationQuality p_\n }\n \n void MultiMesh::set_instance_transform(int p_instance, const Transform3D &p_transform) {\n+\tERR_FAIL_INDEX_MSG(p_instance, instance_count, \"Instance index out of bounds. Instance index must be 0 or a